  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Youth Climate Dialogue Series</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Climate Dialogue Series</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim is to raise the awareness and strengthen youth&#x2019;s knowledge in the UNFCCC negotiations by paving the road towards a successful COP 27 on matters related to climate justice. This will be achieved by providing space for youth and marginalised communities to share their voice and be empowered to take action to address the climate crisis, increase the understanding of the UNFCCC Process for local and global participation, and create a vibrant discussion platform between youth climate actors and climate leaders (government, NGO, development partners, academia, etc.).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Ziel des Vorhabens ist es, das Bewusstsein der ruandischen Jugend hinsichtlich internationaler (UNFCCC) Klimaverhandlungen zu st&#xe4;rken sowie deren Beitrag zu den COP27-Klimaverhandlungen zu Themen der Klimagerechtigkeit zu erarbeiten und einzubringen.</narrative>
  </description>
